<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Uma Musume Academy | Module 05</title>
    
    <!-- Google Fonts for the "Preppy" look (very cool)-->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        /* Base Page Styles */
        body {
            font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f7fffb; /* Soft Turf White */
            color: #444;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* 1. ID Selector: Colorful Nav Bar */
        #main-nav {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #ff9eb5, #ffc1e3); 
            padding: 25px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 158, 181, 0.3);
        }

        /* 2. Descendant Selector (1/3): Styled Nav Links */
        nav a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0 10px;
            padding: 10px 25px;
            border: 2px solid #fff;
            border-radius: 30px;
            transition: 0.3s;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        /* 3. Pseudo-class (:hover): Link Interaction */
        nav a:hover {
            background-color: #fff;
            color: #ff80ab;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        /* 4. Attribute Selector: Off-site Link Styling */
        a[target="_blank"] {
            color: #2e7d32;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: underline wavy #ff80ab;
        }

        /* 5. Pseudo-class (:hover): Off-site Hover */
        a[target="_blank"]:hover {
            color: #ff80ab;
        }

        /* 6. Combinator (Direct Child >): Heading Accents */
        section > h2 {
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
            color: #ad1457;
            font-size: 2rem;
            border-left: 8px solid #ff80ab;
            padding-left: 15px;
        }

        /* 7. Class Selector & Descendant (2/3): Card Backgrounds */
        .game-intro p {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            border: 3px dashed #ffc1e3;
            box-shadow: 10px 10px 0px #e8f5e9;
        }

        /* 8. Adjacent Sibling (+) & Descendant (3/3): Spacing */
        h2 + p {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        /* 9. Pseudo-class (:nth-of-type): Alternating List Colors */
        .stats-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
        .stats-list li { padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 10px; border-radius: 15px; }
        .stats-list li:nth-of-type(even) { background-color: #e8f5e9; color: #2e7d32; }
        .stats-list li:nth-of-type(odd) { background-color: #fce4ec; color: #ad1457; }

        /* 10. !important Rule: Footer Visibility */
        footer p {
            font-size: 0.8rem !important;
            color: #bbb !important;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 50px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1 style="text-align: center; color: #ad1457; font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif; padding-top: 20px;">Tracen Academy Guide</h1>
        <nav id="main-nav">
            <a href="https://github.com/RedRosesx">My Bio</a>
            <a href="https://umamusume.com/">Umamusume Pretty Derby</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main style="max-width: 800px; margin: auto; padding: 20px;">
        <article class="game-intro">
            <h2>The Twinkle Series</h2>
            <p>Welcome to <strong>Uma Musume</strong>! In this game, you train legendary racehorses reborn as horse girls to win the Twinkle Series and perform in Winning Live concerts.</p>
        </article>

        <section>
            <h2>Top 6 Features</h2>
            <ul class="stats-list">
                <li>High-speed 3D racing drama</li>
                <li>Vibrant Winning Live performances</li>
                <li>Strategic training mechanics</li>
                <li>Emotional character-driven stories</li>
                <li>Historical horse racing tributes</li>
                <li>Upbeat, colorful academy life</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <a href="https://umamusume.jp" target="_blank">Official JP Website</a>
        </div>
        <p>&copy; 2024 Tracen Academy | Assignment Module 05</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
